 selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">1技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">2技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3091/309103/罗蕾莱皮肤skill1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3091/309103/罗蕾莱皮肤born.mp4_20260922_180005.429.png\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3091/309103/罗蕾莱皮肤skill2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3091/309103/罗蕾莱皮肤born.mp4_20260922_180005.429.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3091/309103/罗蕾莱皮肤unique.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3091/309103/罗蕾莱皮肤born.mp4_20260922_180005.429.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3091/309103/罗蕾莱皮肤born.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3091/309103/罗蕾莱皮肤born.mp4_20260922_180005.429.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">砖墙内，抚养者诉说爱意，厚重的大门却阻挡了阳光。温暖的手掌将怀抱着她，却也将她紧紧束缚。<br />直到那清冷的声音响起，教会她自由的含义，给予她尽情歌唱的承诺。唱一首歌吧，那个声音说，寻找更多的伙伴。<br />洁白的海螺鸣响，悦耳的歌谣随之轻舞。浪花声中，一个个彩虹色的泡泡浮现——社会的规训、道德的约束、甚至是生命本身，这些牢笼都在阳光的照耀下融化。而此时此刻，她无需在意这一切，只需要唱歌，再下一首歌。<br />海浪往复，螺号鸣响。迷茫的灵魂于此侧耳倾听，在歌声中寻得那份被她慷慨分享的自由。你看——他们已从生命中解脱，在这片海岸陪伴着她，直至永远。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"309103\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-309104.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1d/Belonging-309104.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">凝结的声音<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Voice Congealed</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>流光溢彩的海螺——从黑色的海底捞起，再用月光所辉照的珍珠串联。<br />在她震动空腔吹奏颂歌之前，它们如绶带般安静地凝结在她的身上。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-309105.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/8a/Belonging-309105.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">禁锢，抑或唤醒<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Freedom in Confinement</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />2.1<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>金色的指骨，紧缚着缎带与咽喉。<br />于他者而言，这是对忠诚与誓言的束缚；于受访者而言，这更像一次天性的释放——她不需要再担心不稳定的血统与幻觉，只需随心编织曲调，无拘无束地唱下去。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-309106.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/9b/Belonging-309106.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">抚慰亡者的丝绸<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Death-Soothing Silk</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />47<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一双冷灰色的绸缎手套，以偏光蓝线绣制纹饰。<br />她的歌声引来生命，她的双手为亡魂整理仪容，于是它们的白骨永远驻足在此。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "含有受损文件链接的页面"}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">礁骨回响 <small style=\"color: grey\">Song of the Skeletal Reefs</small></span></span>"}}